"Fix UAF and cross-document lifecycle violation in keyframe snapshot"
(crbugs 574193110 and 580174730, not public; no CVE listed yet): resolving a
style-dependent keyframe in CompositorAnimationCurve::UpdateKeyframeSnapshot
could trigger a synchronous style/layout update that destroyed the curve
mid-loop, a use after free; the curve now holds a reference to itself. Also
fixes the cross-document lifecycle violations this exposed (behind the
SyncCrossDocumentAnimationTiming killswitch). chromium/src main commit
5e57db9b666cb005fb75ad28f481331098c5e169 (2026-10-28), merged on 2026-11-02
to 157 (d0867f2a52246a29e871f88157764eb7d360a59f, after the 157.0.8103.37
tag). This is the 157 merge, without its test. Drop it once a 157 tag has
it.

